    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "19e34b73863148d894aa45fc9668eb7a",
    "m_Title": "Foliage Forge leaf shader",
    "m_Content": "Two custom functions from FoliageForge.hlsl. Vertex: billboard, flutter and wind sway. Surface: colour, lighting, stylized shading, patches and fill texture. Edit the maths in the .hlsl, only wiring lives here.",
